<title>USA: TENNIS-BAUSCH &amp; LOMB CHAMPIONSHIPS WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BAUSCH &amp; LOMB CHAMPIONSHIPS WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMELIA ISLAND, Florida 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bausch &amp; Lomb Championships women's tennis tournament</p>
<p>on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>11-Mary Pierce (France) beat 2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario</p>
<p>(Spain) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>6-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Jana Kandarr (Germany) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>8-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 4-Conchita Martinez (Spain) 1-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>12-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 9-Mary Joe Fernandez</p>
<p>(U.S.) 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
